<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;">{{name}} sent you their address</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;color:#52525b;line-height:1.6;">
  It's in your recipients at {{store.name}}, ready for the next postcard:
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;color:#18181b;line-height:1.6;">
  <strong>{{name}}</strong><br />
  {{address}}
</p>
<p style="margin:24px 0;">
  <a href="{{bookUrl}}" style="display:inline-block;background:{{store.colorAccent}};color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:2px;font-weight:600;">See your recipients</a>
</p>
<p style="margin:0;color:#71717a;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;">
  You asked to be told when someone answers one of your address links. Turn that off on the link
  itself, in your recipients.
</p>
